title: "AgentLoom Runtime: Production Library for Governed Agent Memory and Retrieval"
abstract: >
  AgentLoom Runtime v0.1.0 provides installable modules for database access,
  layered memory and retrieval, knowledge-graph sync, and FAIR/quality validators
  for production agent deployments. It complements the AgentLoom authoring-time
  governance framework. Extracted from research data lifecycle management practice
  at an academic library; public releases are framework-neutral library code only.
version: "0.1.0"
